{"ID":"20240311164545-ubgd7d3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240311164545-ubgd7d3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240311164545-ubgd7d3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172046-rqymoxa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172046-uk14uow\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172046-uk14uow\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:160,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:160\u0026#125;","title":"【干姜黄连黄芩人参汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312172046-rqymoxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-rqymoxa","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百七十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-pnxlbbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-pnxlbbp","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」，本自寒下，医复吐、下之，寒格，更逆吐、下，若食入口即吐者，「干姜黄连黄芩人参汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-ux4qiux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-ux4qiux","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我治疗胰脏癌最重要的处方是这个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-0ap5sf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-0ap5sf9","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胰脏癌很多人的症状，吐下，东西吃下去就开始吐，中膈很痛，这个处方是主力处方。还有一种情形，临床上看，胰脏癌很多人是吃了吐，寒格在中间，吃东西一下吐出来，这个就是「干姜黄连黄芩人参汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-xyt9wnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-xyt9wnn","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜黄连黄芩人参汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-w5x1n2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-w5x1n2g","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜、黄连、黄芩、人参各三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-jcoowzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-jcoowzx","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，分温再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-q9e9wlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-q9e9wlh","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干姜是热药，黄芩黄连是寒凉的药，中间补个人参，就四味药在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜温中，黄芩黄连去热，人参因为他吐下，肠胃津液伤到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-ljx2fvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-ljx2fvj","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8——3"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-1isrnbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-1isrnbl","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人参去补虚，简简单单的四味药，以这四味药为主力。这是一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-e0yshzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-e0yshzs","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一个处方是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花代赭石汤，这个处方来加减，加干姜吴茱萸各三钱，如果病人恶心、呕吐、胃酸很盛就可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个处方下去病人吃到，这两个处方会有个共同的现象，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原来中膈的地方非常的痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，东西已经吃不下去了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有吐酸的时候，就是吃入即吐，干姜黄连黄芩人参汤。旋覆花代赭石汤，这个会吃下去，但是会呕酸，是这个旋覆花代赭石，加干姜吴茱萸各三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人一个礼拜后会大下，代赭石会降逆，大下，下去以后就是黑的大便，下完以后，整个痛就去掉，胃口就恢复了。干姜黄连黄芩人参汤也是一样的现象。这是治疗胰脏癌的时候。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-hhcnzqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-hhcnzqy","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种情形，被诊断是胰脏癌，一般西医诊断出是胰脏癌都是末期了。还有人还在往来寒热，恶心，小柴胡汤症，你开小柴胡汤。按照症来开最好。干姜黄连黄芩人参汤、旋覆花代赭石汤，光是这两个方，就可以针对百分之九十九的胰脏癌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-qhz7ktv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-qhz7ktv","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台北市一个很有名的牙医干了二十几年，他一个好朋友的先生就得了胰脏癌。那他跟我很好啊，这个朋友住在洛杉矶，我在佛尔达，他来找我的时候，我在手上先写‘咖啡’，然后跟他握手，我说你平常最常喝的饮料是什么？（他说）咖啡，然后给他看手上的字，饮料有千百种，我只写一个咖啡，就代表我是对的啊。第一让他马上停掉喝咖啡，持续再喝下去病会继续恶化，所以他一停止喝咖啡，他的病势就能缓下来。第二再给他旋覆花代赭石汤，因为它呕酸的很厉害。后来这个人还是死掉了，他本来治疗的很好啊，结果呢他得了感冒，吃抗生素，你要知道我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在治癌症的时候，不见的癌细胞完全去掉，但是药吃到一个阶段，这个癌不影响你，跟你共存就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以他吃完药两个礼拜以后能吃能喝能拉能睡，精神气色都恢复了，大小便都恢复正常了，可是不见得他的癌细胞都去掉，要注意调养身体。可是他很开心啊，跑到台湾来玩，感冒一吃西药，发病，不是发胰脏癌哦，是肝脓疡，肝化脓啊，送到医院去，不断打抗生素，人就死掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-dp20tzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-dp20tzj","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么？因为他本身就有问题，一接触抗生素，病邪马上跑到厥阴去，热很深的时候里面会化脓，我们有很多好的处方啊，中医有排脓汤有很多处方可以用，可是呢我人在美国，他人在台湾卡在那救不了。本来可以不用死的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-fqvmq5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-fqvmq5h","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「干姜黄连黄芩人参汤」这个药速度很快，当有寒格的时候，所有的癌症都是寒。寒格在中间，胃的中间实际上就是胰脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-9xa65no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-9xa65no","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干姜、黄连、黄芩、人参各三两。不要真的三两，三钱就好了。六碗水煮两碗。早晚各一碗。病人有点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怕风吹，桂枝汤加里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"项强加葛根汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。没有恶寒，就是项强，脖子硬，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脸部有点中风，桂枝汤加葛根"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"基础方不动，可以加一些上去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"比如皮肤很痒，麻黄连翘赤小豆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172046-uk14uow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172046-uk14uow","updated":"20240312172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒格在胃，如果看到不是胰脏癌，同样的症状，结果病人一吃下去就吐，东西吃不下去，又吐又下，寒格在中间，喝热水比较暖和一点，喝冷水不行，都是寒格。都可以使用「干姜黄连黄芩人参汤」这个处方。不用管他里面的症是什么东西。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当把病人救回来的时候，可能病还在那边。可能好很多，但是还有一点，不要去挖他"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要用西医的数值去判断中医无效。"}]}]}